    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869320/extras/e580f7560790c1b3f63a852eff28ea9e.avif?t=1741938650\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Discord URL :<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Story\u3011</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869320/extras/d4fe8dea0ed02115500d750bc643999a.poster.avif?t=1741938650\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869320/extras/d4fe8dea0ed02115500d750bc643999a.webm?t=1741938650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869320/extras/d4fe8dea0ed02115500d750bc643999a.mp4?t=1741938650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Guided by a mysterious girl, adventurers challenge a labyrinth that changes its shape with every entry, aiming for the lowest layer.<br>A new sensation RPG that adds soul-like and rogue-lite elements to a Wizardry-like 3D dungeon RPG.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010System\u3011</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869320/extras/a6fb1d2f4329e5cb22610e153032bd0b.poster.avif?t=1741938650\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869320/extras/a6fb1d2f4329e5cb22610e153032bd0b.webm?t=1741938650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2869320/extras/a6fb1d2f4329e5cb22610e153032bd0b.mp4?t=1741938650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This is a roguelike game based on the classic 3D dungeon RPG!<br><br>- Players challenge randomly generated 3D dungeons with their companions each time!<br>- Various events occur randomly within the dungeon! You can enjoy a different adventure each time!<br>- Customize your characters freely with special beads created through item alchemy!<br>- Various events, such as merchants and traps, occur inside the dungeon!<br><br>This RPG has a high level of difficulty, but there are dungeons where bringing items is allowed, letting players adjust the difficulty themselves.<br>Furthermore, by experiencing death repeatedly, your understanding of the labyrinth will deepen, allowing you to feel your own growth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Regarding Video Posting &amp; Streaming\u3011</h2>Please include the URL to the &quot;Soul Wizards &amp; Roguelite&quot; Steam store page in the description section.<br>Feel free to monetize as well.",
