s occur randomly within the dungeon! You can enjoy a different adventure each time!<br>- Customize your characters freely with special beads created through item alchemy!<br>- Various events, such as merchants and traps, occur inside the dungeon!<br><br>This RPG has a high level of difficulty, but there are dungeons where bringing items is allowed, letting players adjust the difficulty themselves.<br>Furthermore, by experiencing death repeatedly, your understanding of the labyrinth will deepen, allowing you to feel your own growth!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Regarding Video Posting &amp; Streaming\u3011</h2>Please include the URL to the &quot;Soul Wizards &amp; Roguelite&quot; Steam store page in the description section.<br>Feel free to monetize as well.",
